The protocol this speaks is written down in Sources/PlayableAirplay.docc from
published descriptions and from measurements taken here. Those are facts about a
wire rather than anybody's code, and every statement names where it came from.
No source was taken from any project, and none from a GPL or AGPL one.

The sender was written against that record rather than ported. Until 2026-09-23
this package built airplay2-sender-cpp, Mbed TLS and ed25519 from source instead,
and their notices travelled with them; none of that code remains.

